{"text": "Leaving his family at home, Pahom set out with his servant, taking tea, wine, and other presents for the Bashkirs. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The Bashkirs lived in tents on the wide steppe, where they kept horses and drank mares milk. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They did not plow the land at all, and they spent the summer drinking tea, eating mutton, and playing music. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Pleased with Pahoms gifts, they told him through an interpreter that he could choose any land he liked. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then their chief arrived in a fox fur cap, and Pahom asked him what price he wanted for the land. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Our price is always the same, one thousand rubles a day, said the chief, and Pahom did not understand. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The chief explained that Pahom could have all the land that he could walk around in one day. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But if you do not return to the starting place before sunset, your money is lost, he warned. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Pahom was so excited that he could not sleep, thinking of the huge piece of land he would mark out. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Just before dawn he dozed off and dreamed of the Devil laughing beside a dead man, who was Pahom himself.", "alignment": {"characters": ["L", "e", "a", "v", "i", "n", "g", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "f", "a", "m", "i", "l", "y", " ", "a", "t", " ", "h", "o", "m", "e", ",", " ", "P", "a", "h", "o", "m", " ", "s", "e", "t", " ", "o", "u", "t", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "s", "e", "r", "v", "a", "n", "t", ",", " ", "t", "a", "k", "i", "n", "g", " ", "t", "e", "a", ",", " ", "w", "i", "n", "e", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "o", "t", "h", "e", "r", " ", "p", "r", "e", "s", "e", "n", "t", "s", " ", "f", "o", "r", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "B", "a", "s", "h", "k", "i", "r", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "B", "a", "s", "h", "k